OL,3,GNEWSASwimming pool to close over half
OL,4,Aterm for repairs
OL,5,
OL,6,FA swimming pool is to be closed for
OL,7,Fessential maintenance over half term,
OL,8,Fjust 16 months after undergoing a
OL,9,F#900,000 refurbishment.
OL,11,FThe Leisure Centre in Keighley reopened
OL,12,Fin June 2025 after it was closed for
OL,13,Ffive months for new swimming pool
OL,14,Ffiltration, slide repairs, electrical
OL,15,Fimprovements and the fitting of solar
OL,16,Fpanels.
OL,18,FHowever Bradford Council, which runs
OL,19,Fthe centre, said urgent repairs were
OL,20,Fnow needed to the main drain, as well
OL,21,Fas deep clean of the pool and the
OL,22,Ffixing of pool tiles.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,382,380,200,160,0,100
