OL,3,GNEWSASwimming pool to close over half
OL,4,Aterm for repairs
OL,5,
OL,6,FIan Walker, portfolio holder for
OL,7,Fneighbourhoods and communities, said he
OL,8,Fappreciated the temporary closure would
OL,9,Fbe "frustrating for customers".
